  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Puppet Manipulation — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally, at 18th level, you reach the peak of your technique. Your manipulation is now no longer limited to puppets. You can now manipulate the creatures in your domain like puppets in a puppet show.<br />\nAt initiative 20, all creatures take an action of your choice that does not cost cursed energy.</p>",
